    "brief": "The Board's Unattached agents section (#agents) at http://127.0.0.1:50375/",
    "briefText": "Baseline stage of the gui-improve walk on the unattached-agents panel. Tonight a worker whose cwd was a worktree appeared in that section with no way to see which tree it belonged to. The round's brief: make the section say where an unattached card's directory actually is and offer the right tree.",
